OL,3,GNEWSAThree teens guilty of murdering   
OL,4,Aman in skate park                      
OL,6,FThree male teenagers have been found   
OL,7,Fguilty of murder after a fight with    
OL,8,Fmachetes left one man dead and another 
OL,9,Fseriously injured.                     
OL,11,FA six-week trial at Northampton Crown  
OL,12,FCourt heard that Mason Miller, 20, died
OL,13,Fafter being stabbed in the chest during
OL,14,Fa fight at Briar Hill Skate Park in    
OL,15,FRingway, Northampton, at about 15:30   
OL,16,FGMT on 18 February.                    
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
