OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAThree teens guilty of murdering   
OL,4,Aman in skate park                      
OL,6,FThe three teenagers convicted were aged
OL,7,F16, 17 and 18, and cannot be named for 
OL,8,Flegal reasons. The 16-year-old and     
OL,9,F17-year-old were also found guilty of  
OL,10,Fattempted murder of another            
OL,11,F18-year-old.                           
OL,13,FDet Insp Matt Bly, from the East       
OL,14,FMidlands special operations unit, said:
OL,15,F"We hope these verdicts provide some   
OL,16,Fcomfort to [Miller's] family."         
